# 18. CI/CD Best Practices

✔ Build once.

✔ Deploy same artifact everywhere.

✔ Keep runtime image minimal.

✔ Version every image.

✔ Store images in Registry.

✔ Automate deployments.

✔ Keep YAML in Git.

✔ Use Helm for complex deployments.

---

# 19. Trainer Nuggets 💡

- Docker Strategy is preferred.
- Build Pods are temporary.
- ImageStreams simplify version tracking.
- Helm packages multiple Kubernetes resources.
- Production images should be as small as possible.
- Build once, deploy many times.

